Trademarks
----------

OCPP and Open Charge Alliance are names of the Open Charge Alliance. This
module is not made, endorsed, certified or supported by the Open Charge
Alliance, and is not affiliated with it; the names are used only to say
which protocol it simulates.

Specifications
--------------

No specification text is reproduced. The OCPP documents (1.6 edition 2
with OCPP-J 1.6 and OCPP-S 1.6, the 1.6 security whitepaper, 2.0.1
edition 4 and 2.1 edition 2), published by the Open Charge Alliance under
CC BY-ND 4.0, are used for facts only. The OCA JSON schemas and WSDLs
the simulator checks its messages against are embedded in the ocpp
module (unmodified, CC BY-ND 4.0; see that module's NOTICE), not in this
one.

